+/// picked up per exec), the env < flag < `/timer` override order, the
+/// one-shot wrap-up steering notices riding the existing
+/// `<system-notice>` machinery, and the headless byte-for-byte REG when
+/// no deadline is set.
+void main() {
+  late MemoryExecutionEnv env;
+  late FakeCliIO io;
